# The tool's guards confine its state file to this directory (see lib.mjs), but
# `--state` / `--out` may still name it something other than the default, and the
# repo-root .gitignore only knows the default name. Every one of those files
# carries the seeded fleet's password and the parent's PIN in plain text, so the
# rule here is by location rather than by name: nothing this tool writes is
# tracked. The tool itself is .mjs and .md — a .json in here is always output.
*.json
